  "prefLabel": "Rev 2007.07 Form MS-123, Report of Town/City/Village Officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2007.07 Form MS-123, Report of Town/City/Village Officials.\n\n(a) The MS-123, “Report of Town/City/Village Officials,” is available at the department’s website at https://www.revenue.nh.gov/sites/g/files/ehbemt736/files/documents/ms-123_pro.pdf.\n\n(b) The MS-123 shall be certified and submitted utilizing the MTRSP by the village clerk within 20 days after election or appointment pursuant to RSA 41:19.\n\nSource. #10675, eff 9-24-14 (formerly Rev 2008.08), ss by #14072, eff 9-10-24 (formerly 2007.09)\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRULE | STATUTE\n\nRev 2001.01 - Rev 2001.19 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 21:47\n\nRev 2002.01 - Rev 2002.03 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17\n\nRev 2003.01 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17\n\nRev 2004.01 - Rev 2004.08 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17\n\nRev 2005.01 - Rev 2005.11 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 52:4-a\n\nRev 2006.01 - Rev 2006.03 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 21-J:34\n\nRev 2007.01 - Rev 2007.03 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 21-J:34\n\nRev 2007.04 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 21-J:34, RSA 52:16\n\nRev 2007.05 -Rev 2007.09 | RSA 21-J:13, IV, RSA 21-J:17, RSA 21-J:34, RSA 670:9, RSA 21:5",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2000.html"
